              "help": {
                "markdown": "Resource exhaustion: Unbounded request threads. Categories: Uncontrolled request triggered background concurrency. Weaknesses: CWE-770.\n\n## Remediation\n\nRoute preview fetches, clip-info sweeps, and webhook deliveries through small bounded executors or queues with explicit capacity. Maintain per-viewkey pending Futures/single-flight state before worker creation, deduplicate queue sweep keys globally, coalesce repeated MLT wakes, and reject or drop work when capacity is full. Add per-client throttles and downstream delivery backoff/idempotency.",
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Unbounded request threads. Categories: Uncontrolled request triggered background concurrency. Weaknesses: CWE-770.\n\nRemediation:\n\nRoute preview fetches, clip-info sweeps, and webhook deliveries through small bounded executors or queues with explicit capacity. Maintain per-viewkey pending Futures/single-flight state before worker creation, deduplicate queue sweep keys globally, coalesce repeated MLT wakes, and reject or drop work when capacity is full. Add per-client throttles and downstream delivery backoff/idempotency."
              },
              "id": "resource-exhaustion.unbounded-request-threads",
              "name": "Resource exhaustion: Unbounded request threads",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.9",
                "tags": [
                  "Uncontrolled request-triggered background concurrency",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-770",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Unbounded request threads"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Unbounded source scan. Categories: Unbounded and non isolated file backed source ingestion. Weaknesses: CWE-20, CWE-400."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Resource exhaustion: Unbounded source scan. Categories: Unbounded and non isolated file backed source ingestion. Weaknesses: CWE-20, CWE-400.\n\n## Remediation\n\nFor each candidate path, use lstat/open-no-follow semantics and accept only regular files whose resolved/opened identity remains beneath SOURCES_DIR. Enforce per-file and aggregate byte, record, nesting, string-length, and processing-time budgets before parsing. Validate basenames with fullmatch and check every match before accessing groups. Put all filename parsing and file processing inside a per-file exception boundary so one bad source is skipped and logged. Consider a resource-limited worker for source parsing and commit only a complete validated snapshot.",
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Unbounded source scan. Categories: Unbounded and non isolated file backed source ingestion. Weaknesses: CWE-20, CWE-400.\n\nRemediation:\n\nFor each candidate path, use lstat/open-no-follow semantics and accept only regular files whose resolved/opened identity remains beneath SOURCES_DIR. Enforce per-file and aggregate byte, record, nesting, string-length, and processing-time budgets before parsing. Validate basenames with fullmatch and check every match before accessing groups. Put all filename parsing and file processing inside a per-file exception boundary so one bad source is skipped and logged. Consider a resource-limited worker for source parsing and commit only a complete validated snapshot."
              },
              "id": "resource-exhaustion.unbounded-source-scan",
              "name": "Resource exhaustion: Unbounded source scan",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.6",
                "tags": [
                  "Unbounded and non-isolated file-backed source ingestion",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-020",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-400",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Unbounded source scan"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SSRF: Source metadata media resolution. Categories: Server side request forgery through unvalidated integration metadata. Weaknesses: CWE-918."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "SSRF: Source metadata media resolution. Categories: Server side request forgery through unvalidated integration metadata. Weaknesses: CWE-918.\n\n## Remediation\n\nSeparate display links from trusted server-fetch targets. Construct fetch URLs from validated site plus native identifier wherever possible. When a slug is required, parse the URL and require the exact documented site host or properly delimited site suffix and expected port. Resolve DNS and reject loopback, link-local, private, multicast, and other non-public addresses; repeat validation after every redirect and for every extractor-returned playlist, segment, or format URL. Add network-level egress controls as defense in depth, and rebuild cached indexes after deployment.",
                "text": "SSRF: Source metadata media resolution. Categories: Server side request forgery through unvalidated integration metadata. Weaknesses: CWE-918.\n\nRemediation:\n\nSeparate display links from trusted server-fetch targets. Construct fetch URLs from validated site plus native identifier wherever possible. When a slug is required, parse the URL and require the exact documented site host or properly delimited site suffix and expected port. Resolve DNS and reject loopback, link-local, private, multicast, and other non-public addresses; repeat validation after every redirect and for every extractor-returned playlist, segment, or format URL. Add network-level egress controls as defense in depth, and rebuild cached indexes after deployment."
              },
              "id": "ssrf.source-metadata-media-resolution",
              "name": "SSRF: Source metadata media resolution",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "6.4",
                "tags": [
                  "Server-side request forgery through unvalidated integration metadata",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-918",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "SSRF: Source metadata media resolution"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Stored XSS: Vote restore note time. Categories: Stored browser injection caused by inconsistent nested restore validation. Weaknesses: CWE-79."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Stored XSS: Vote restore note time. Categories: Stored browser injection caused by inconsistent nested restore validation. Weaknesses: CWE-79.\n\n## Remediation\n\nDo not accept a client-supplied vote entry as an undo token. Retain previous state server-side or issue an opaque, integrity-protected reference. If restore remains, reconstruct the entry from explicitly validated fields and run notes through clean_notes before persistence. In the browser, require finite numeric timestamps and create note elements with DOM APIs/textContent/dataset instead of HTML strings. A restrictive script-src CSP adds defense in depth after inline handlers are removed or nonced.",
                "text": "Stored XSS: Vote restore note time. Categories: Stored browser injection caused by inconsistent nested restore validation. Weaknesses: CWE-79.\n\nRemediation:\n\nDo not accept a client-supplied vote entry as an undo token. Retain previous state server-side or issue an opaque, integrity-protected reference. If restore remains, reconstruct the entry from explicitly validated fields and run notes through clean_notes before persistence. In the browser, require finite numeric timestamps and create note elements with DOM APIs/textContent/dataset instead of HTML strings. A restrictive script-src CSP adds defense in depth after inline handlers are removed or nonced."
              },
              "id": "stored-xss.vote-restore-note-time",
              "name": "Stored XSS: Vote restore note time",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "6.1",
                "tags": [
                  "Stored browser injection caused by inconsistent nested restore validation",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-079",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Stored XSS: Vote restore note time"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unsafe browser test: Unsandboxed external embed. Categories: Developer tool isolation failure for untrusted browser content. Weaknesses: CWE-693."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unsafe browser test: Unsandboxed external embed. Categories: Developer tool isolation failure for untrusted browser content. Weaknesses: CWE-693.\n\n## Remediation\n\nRemove --no-sandbox for developer-host execution. Block all non-loopback browser egress and replace the third-party embed with a local stub or CDP request interception. If the browser sandbox cannot run in the target environment, execute this test inside a dedicated unprivileged container or VM with no secrets, no sensitive writable mounts, and no Internet access.",
                "text": "Unsafe browser test: Unsandboxed external embed. Categories: Developer tool isolation failure for untrusted browser content. Weaknesses: CWE-693.\n\nRemediation:\n\nRemove --no-sandbox for developer-host execution. Block all non-loopback browser egress and replace the third-party embed with a local stub or CDP request interception. If the browser sandbox cannot run in the target environment, execute this test inside a dedicated unprivileged container or VM with no secrets, no sensitive writable mounts, and no Internet access."
              },
              "id": "unsafe-browser-test.unsandboxed-external-embed",
              "name": "Unsafe browser test: Unsandboxed external embed",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.3",
                "tags": [
                  "Developer-tool isolation failure for untrusted browser content",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-693",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unsafe browser test: Unsandboxed external embed"
              }
            }
          ],
          "version": "0.1.95"
        }
      }
    }
